  "content": "<h1><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/2afbeabadf7e4c81d517f794066466f90d1f2f1a.png\" alt=\"IrisSearch 标志\" width=\"60\" height=\"auto\"> &nbsp; IrisSearch</h1><div style=\"display:flex;text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Discord-050d18?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=black&amp;labelColor=e5f7ff\"> </a><a href=\"https://github.com/SpacEagle17/IrisSearch\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"源码\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Source-050d18?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=black&amp;labelColor=e5f7ff\"> </a><img alt=\"Iris Search\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Iris | Oculus | 及其衍生版本-050d18?style=for-the-badge&amp;logoColor=black&amp;label=适用平台:&amp;labelColor=050d18&amp;color=e5f7ff\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"支持\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Spaceagle17-050d18?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=patreon&amp;logoColor=black&amp;label=支持作者&amp;labelColor=e5f7ff\"></a></div><h2>一款在 Iris/Oculus 光影设置界面中直接添加功能性搜索栏的模组，让你能瞬间找到特定光影选项。</h2><h2>🔍 为什么要用这个模组？</h2><p>厌倦了为了找到诸如飘动的树叶或泛光之类的特定开关，而在一页页和子菜单中不停点击吗？</p><p>IrisSearch 将搜索栏直接嵌入光影选项界面。输入你要找的内容，菜单就会动态筛选出匹配的设置！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252frLCE-IV_fng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fa075629-4a4e-48b6-8c27-effac8420b9f\" alt=\"YouTube 视频\"></a></p><h2>功能特点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>界面内搜索栏：</strong>在光影包选项菜单中直接添加一个无缝集成的文本输入框。</li>\n<li><strong>翻译支持：</strong>可以使用你选择的语言进行搜索（如果光影支持该语言）。模组本身也支持翻译。欢迎在 <a href=\"https://github.com/SpacEagle17/IrisSearch/tree/main/common/src/main/resources/assets/iris_search/lang\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 此处</a>贡献翻译。</li>\n<li><strong>无需配置：</strong>开箱即用，无需编辑任何配置文件。</li>\n<li><strong>加载器兼容性：</strong>支持 Fabric、Forge 和 NeoForge。</li>\n<li><strong>版本支持：</strong>兼容从 1.20.1 到最新版本的 Minecraft。</li>\n</ul><h2>相关链接</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fsupport%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon 或 Kofi</a> 上支持 SpacEagle17</strong></li>\n<li><strong>联系方式：</strong> <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252feuphoriapatches.com%252fcontact\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://euphoriapatches.com/contact</a></strong></li>\n<li><strong>Discord 群组：</strong> <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.euphoriapatches.com/discord</a></strong></li>\n</ul><h2>由 Ember Host 赞助</h2><p>正在寻找价格实惠且可靠的 Minecraft 服务器托管商？Ember Host 提供超高性价比和顶级支持！</p><p>点击横幅或在结算时使用优惠码 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.euphoriapatches.com%252fember-referral\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">EUPHORIA</a></strong> 即可享受首次购买 <strong>9 折</strong>优惠。此外，你支付的 <strong>70%</strong> 将用于支持 Euphoria Patches！</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbit.ly%252f0932rwjieopf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.euphoriapatches.com/assets/img/other/ember_host_ep.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
